-- ==========================================================================
-- Cymru Compliance — seed content
-- Self-assessment questions are derived from the HIW dental inspection
-- workbook (Findings and Recommendations). They are a practical starting
-- set, NOT an official HIW product: have a dental compliance expert confirm
-- them against the current HIW framework / Private Dentistry (Wales)
-- Regulations before practices rely on the score.
-- Training outlines are illustrative. Welsh text is not yet proofread.
-- ==========================================================================


insert into public.assessment_questions (category, ref, text_en, text_cy, hint_en, sort) values
('registration','R1','HIW certificates of registration are displayed for every dentist who undertakes private work, and are correct and up to date.','Mae tystysgrifau cofrestru AGIC wedi''u harddangos ar gyfer pob deintydd sy''n gwneud gwaith preifat, ac maent yn gywir ac yn gyfredol.','Observation of certificates; compare names with the dentist list.',1),
('registration','R2','Employer''s and public liability insurance certificates are in date and on display.','Mae tystysgrifau yswiriant atebolrwydd cyflogwr ac atebolrwydd cyhoeddus o fewn eu dyddiad ac wedi''u harddangos.','Observation of certificate and expiry date.',2),
('registration','R3','The practice regularly asks patients for their views (surveys, comments, suggestion box) and acts on them.','Mae''r practis yn gofyn yn rheolaidd i gleifion am eu barn (arolygon, sylwadau, blwch awgrymiadau) ac yn gweithredu arni.','Patient survey results, ''you said, we did'' evidence, staff interview.',3),
('registration','R4','The practice has a complaints procedure compliant with ''Putting Things Right'' (NHS) and, for private care, giving HIW''s contact details.','Mae gan y practis weithdrefn gwynion sy''n cydymffurfio â ''Gweithio i Wella'' (GIG) ac, ar gyfer gofal preifat, sy''n rhoi manylion cyswllt AGIC.','Complaints policy; complaints poster/leaflets on display.',4),
('registration','R5','Complaints, including verbal and informal concerns, are recorded in a log, and common themes are reviewed and acted on.','Cofnodir cwynion, gan gynnwys pryderon llafar ac anffurfiol, mewn log, ac adolygir a gweithredir ar themâu cyffredin.','Complaints log or file; evidence of themes discussed at meetings.',5),
('registration','R6','Staff are encouraged to raise concerns, and there is regular evidence of learning from staff meetings.','Anogir staff i godi pryderon, ac mae tystiolaeth reolaidd o ddysgu o gyfarfodydd staff.','Meeting minutes; staff interview.',6),
('registration','R7','Clinical governance and quality assurance arrangements are in place, including peer review and clinical audit.','Mae trefniadau llywodraethu clinigol a sicrhau ansawdd ar waith, gan gynnwys adolygu gan gymheiriaid ac archwilio clinigol.','Audit schedule and results; peer review records.',7),
('registration','R8','The practice website (if any) complies with GDC guidance, and a price list is displayed (GDC Standards 2.4.1).','Mae gwefan y practis (os oes un) yn cydymffurfio â chanllawiau''r GDC, ac mae rhestr brisiau wedi''i harddangos (Safonau''r GDC 2.4.1).','Website review; price list on display in reception.',8),
('registration','R9','A consumer credit licence is held if payment plans of more than four instalments are offered.','Mae trwydded credyd defnyddwyr yn cael ei dal os cynigir cynlluniau talu o fwy na phedwar rhandaliad.','Licence document, where applicable.',9),
('registration','R10','Patient records are audited: medical history signed and updated, charting, BPE, consent, treatment planning, recall and referrals are recorded.','Archwilir cofnodion cleifion: hanes meddygol wedi''i lofnodi a''i ddiweddaru, siartio, BPE, cydsyniad, cynllunio triniaeth, galw''n ôl a chyfeiriadau wedi''u cofnodi.','Random sample of 5 records per clinician.',10),
('registration','R11','Patients are told the risks, benefits and alternatives and give informed consent; oral health, smoking cessation and cancer screening advice is given (Delivering Better Oral Health).','Dywedir wrth gleifion am y risgiau, y buddion a''r dewisiadau eraill ac maent yn rhoi caniatâd gwybodus; rhoddir cyngor iechyd y geg, rhoi''r gorau i smygu a sgrinio canser.','Patient records; clinician interview.',11),
('staff_training','T1','All clinical staff are registered with the GDC, and registration is checked annually.','Mae pob aelod clinigol o staff wedi''i gofrestru gyda''r GDC, a gwirir y gofrestriaeth yn flynyddol.','GDC register check printout for each clinician.',12),
('staff_training','T2','Every member of staff has a contract of employment.','Mae gan bob aelod o staff gontract cyflogaeth.','Staff files.',13),
('staff_training','T3','All clinical staff have a DBS certificate, and appropriate pre-employment checks are done for other staff.','Mae gan bob aelod clinigol o staff dystysgrif DBS, a gwneir gwiriadau cyn cyflogi priodol ar gyfer staff eraill.','DBS record and staff files.',14),
('staff_training','T4','CPD records are up to date for all relevant staff.','Mae cofnodion DPP yn gyfredol ar gyfer yr holl staff perthnasol.','CPD logs and certificates.',15),
('staff_training','T5','Immunisation records are held for relevant staff, including Hepatitis B clearance and checks for Hepatitis C and HIV where appropriate.','Cedwir cofnodion imiwneiddio ar gyfer staff perthnasol, gan gynnwys clirio Hepatitis B a gwiriadau ar gyfer Hepatitis C a HIV lle bo''n briodol.','Occupational health or immunisation records.',16),
('staff_training','T6','All clinical staff have valid professional indemnity cover.','Mae gan bob aelod clinigol o staff yswiriant indemniad proffesiynol dilys.','Indemnity certificates with expiry dates.',17),
('staff_training','T7','There is an induction programme for new staff, and records show it was completed.','Mae rhaglen sefydlu ar gyfer staff newydd, ac mae cofnodion yn dangos iddi gael ei chwblhau.','Induction checklist in staff files.',18),
('staff_training','T8','Agency staff (e.g. dental nurses) are checked for competence, training and DBS before they work.','Gwirir cymhwysedd, hyfforddiant a DBS staff asiantaeth (e.e. nyrsys deintyddol) cyn iddynt weithio.','Agency checks, if agency staff are used.',19),
('staff_training','T9','Regular staff appraisals take place and are recorded.','Cynhelir arfarniadau staff rheolaidd a''u cofnodi.','Appraisal records.',20),
('staff_training','T10','All staff have received child protection and adult protection (safeguarding) training, in date.','Mae pob aelod o staff wedi cael hyfforddiant amddiffyn plant ac amddiffyn oedolion (diogelu), o fewn dyddiad.','Training certificates; safeguarding lead named.',21),
('staff_training','T11','All staff have in-date CPR and emergency resuscitation training, including anaphylaxis.','Mae gan bob aelod o staff hyfforddiant CPR ac adfywio brys o fewn dyddiad, gan gynnwys anaffylacsis.','Training certificates for every member of staff.',22),
('staff_training','T12','Support is available for vaccinations and sharps injuries, and staff know the procedure.','Mae cymorth ar gael ar gyfer brechiadau ac anafiadau miniog, ac mae staff yn gwybod y drefn.','Sharps injury protocol; staff interview.',23),
('staff_training','T13','A named first aider is appointed.','Mae swyddog cymorth cyntaf a enwir wedi''i benodi.','Named first aider notice and certificate.',24),
('decontamination','D1','Decontamination follows WHTM 01-05 and is documented, with routine infection control audits.','Mae diheintio yn dilyn WHTM 01-05 ac wedi''i ddogfennu, gydag archwiliadau rheoli heintiau rheolaidd.','Decontamination policy and latest audit (e.g. IPS/Wales audit tool).',25),
('decontamination','D2','Each autoclave has a logbook with start-of-day and end-of-day checks (including emptying the water reservoir).','Mae gan bob awtoclaf lyfr log gyda gwiriadau dechrau''r dydd a diwedd y dydd (gan gynnwys gwagio''r gronfa ddŵr).','Autoclave logbooks.',26),
('decontamination','D3','Pre-sterilisation cleaning is by washer-disinfector or ultrasonic bath, or by validated manual cleaning, with records.','Mae glanhau cyn sterileiddio drwy olchwr-diheintydd neu faddon ultrasonig, neu lanhau â llaw wedi''i ddilysu, gyda chofnodion.','Observation; cleaning logs.',27),
('decontamination','D4','Autoclave types (B, N or S) are suitable for the instruments processed.','Mae mathau''r awtoclaf (B, N neu S) yn addas ar gyfer yr offerynnau a brosesir.','Equipment list; manufacturer information.',28),
('decontamination','D5','Autoclaves have a maintenance scheme and an in-date inspection certificate (maximum interval 14 months).','Mae gan awtoclafau gynllun cynnal a chadw a thystysgrif archwilio o fewn dyddiad (uchafswm 14 mis).','Written scheme and inspection certificate.',29),
('decontamination','D6','Instrument processing is separated from other clinical work, with two dedicated sinks (or bowls) plus dedicated hand washing.','Mae prosesu offerynnau wedi''i wahanu oddi wrth waith clinigol arall, gyda dau sinc pwrpasol (neu fowlenni) a sinc golchi dwylo pwrpasol.','Observation of the decontamination room.',30),
('decontamination','D7','Instruments are stored correctly, transported safely between surgery and decontamination room, and used within the specified time of processing.','Storir offerynnau''n gywir, eu cludo''n ddiogel rhwng y feddygfa a''r ystafell ddiheintio, a''u defnyddio o fewn yr amser penodedig ar ôl eu prosesu.','Observation; storage and date-marking.',31),
('decontamination','D8','Dental impressions are disinfected before going to the laboratory, and the laboratory is MHRA registered.','Diheintir argraffiadau deintyddol cyn mynd i''r labordy, ac mae''r labordy wedi''i gofrestru gyda''r MHRA.','Impression disinfection procedure; lab registration.',32),
('decontamination','D9','Staff have decontamination training with individual records.','Mae gan staff hyfforddiant diheintio gyda chofnodion unigol.','Training records.',33),
('radiation','X1','The practice has notified HSE of its radiological protection arrangements.','Mae''r practis wedi hysbysu HSE am ei drefniadau diogelu rhag ymbelydredd.','Copy of notification letter.',34),
('radiation','X2','A Radiation Protection File holds the named Radiation Protection Supervisor and Radiation Protection Adviser, controlled area identification and working instructions.','Mae Ffeil Diogelu rhag Ymbelydredd yn cynnwys y Goruchwyliwr Diogelu rhag Ymbelydredd a''r Cynghorydd Diogelu rhag Ymbelydredd a enwir, adnabod ardal reoledig a chyfarwyddiadau gwaith.','Radiation Protection File; local rules displayed.',35),
('radiation','X3','Every X-ray machine has an in-date critical examination, acceptance and routine test certificate.','Mae gan bob peiriant pelydr-X dystysgrif archwiliad critigol, derbyn a phrawf arferol o fewn dyddiad.','Test certificates per machine.',36),
('radiation','X4','Staff wear personal dose badges where required, and results are reviewed.','Mae staff yn gwisgo bathodynnau dos personol lle bo angen, ac adolygir y canlyniadau.','Dose monitoring records.',37),
('radiation','X5','Image quality assurance audits are carried out and a quality grade (1, 2 or 3) is recorded for radiographs.','Cynhelir archwiliadau sicrhau ansawdd delweddau a chofnodir gradd ansawdd (1, 2 neu 3) ar gyfer radiograffau.','QA audit and sample of radiographs.',38),
('radiation','X6','If processing is automatic there is a logbook; if manual, a safe light, heated tanks, thermometer, timer and logbook.','Os yw''r prosesu''n awtomatig mae llyfr log; os â llaw, golau diogel, tanciau wedi''u gwresogi, thermomedr, amserydd a llyfr log.','Observation; processing logs (not applicable for digital).',39),
('radiation','X7','Staff have ionising radiation (IR(ME)R) training within the last 5 years, documented.','Mae gan staff hyfforddiant ymbelydredd ïoneiddio (IR(ME)R) o fewn y 5 mlynedd diwethaf, wedi''i ddogfennu.','Training certificates.',40),
('radiation','X8','X-ray room controls are in place: local rules visible, warning lights, isolation switch and operating switch position, and film-holding aids available.','Mae rheolyddion ystafell pelydr-X ar waith: rheolau lleol i''w gweld, goleuadau rhybudd, switsh ynysu a lleoliad y switsh gweithredu, ac offer dal ffilm ar gael.','Observation of the X-ray room.',41),
('radiation','X9','Radiographs are justified, appropriate views taken, clinical findings noted and the frequency follows guidance.','Mae radiograffau wedi''u cyfiawnhau, cymerir golygon priodol, nodir canfyddiadau clinigol ac mae''r amlder yn dilyn canllawiau.','Patient records.',42),
('radiation','X10','Any lasers are registered with HIW.','Mae unrhyw laserau wedi''u cofrestru gydag AGIC.','Laser registration, where applicable.',43),
('health_safety','H1','A fire risk assessment is in place, fire exits are signposted with instructions, and extinguishers are maintained under a contract (labelled).','Mae asesiad risg tân ar waith, mae allanfeydd tân wedi''u harwyddo gyda chyfarwyddiadau, ac mae diffoddwyr yn cael eu cynnal o dan gytundeb (wedi''u labelu).','Fire risk assessment; extinguisher labels; alarm and drill records.',44),
('health_safety','H2','The practice is accessible (Equality Act): ramp or lift, handrails, wheelchair-accessible doorways and toilet, reserved parking.','Mae''r practis yn hygyrch (Deddf Cydraddoldeb): ramp neu lifft, canllawiau, drysau a thoiled hygyrch i gadeiriau olwyn, parcio neilltuedig.','Observation; accessibility statement.',45),
('health_safety','H3','External signage shows the dentists'' names and qualifications, opening hours and an emergency number; patients are told how to reach emergency care out of hours.','Mae arwyddion allanol yn dangos enwau a chymwysterau''r deintyddion, oriau agor a rhif argyfwng; dywedir wrth gleifion sut i gael gofal brys y tu allan i oriau.','Observation; answerphone message.',46),
('health_safety','H4','General conditions are satisfactory: lighting (including emergency), heating, ventilation, cleanliness and signage; toilets are clean with hand washing and sanitary disposal.','Mae amodau cyffredinol yn foddhaol: goleuo (gan gynnwys argyfwng), gwresogi, awyru, glanweithdra ac arwyddion; mae toiledau''n lân gyda golchi dwylo a gwaredu glanweithiol.','Observation of premises.',47),
('health_safety','H5','Patient records, radiographs and computer data are stored securely, with off-site backup, and confidential conversations can be private.','Storir cofnodion cleifion, radiograffau a data cyfrifiadurol yn ddiogel, gyda chopi wrth gefn oddi ar y safle, a gellir cynnal sgyrsiau cyfrinachol yn breifat.','Observation; backup procedure.',48),
('health_safety','H6','The Health and Safety poster, patient information leaflets, no-smoking signs and complaints poster are displayed.','Mae''r poster Iechyd a Diogelwch, taflenni gwybodaeth i gleifion, arwyddion dim smygu a''r poster cwynion wedi''u harddangos.','Observation.',49),
('health_safety','H7','Resuscitation equipment is complete and checked: first aid kit, face masks, Ambu-bag, airways, portable oxygen (30 minutes'' supply minimum), portable suction and an AED.','Mae offer adfywio yn gyflawn ac wedi''i wirio: bocs cymorth cyntaf, masgiau wyneb, bag Ambu, llwybrau anadlu, ocsigen cludadwy (cyflenwad 30 munud o leiaf), sugnydd cludadwy a diffibriliwr (AED).','Observation; equipment check log.',50),
('health_safety','H8','Emergency drugs are held in line with local requirements, are in date, and a log records regular checks and replacement of expired drugs, syringes and needles.','Cedwir cyffuriau brys yn unol â gofynion lleol, maent o fewn dyddiad, ac mae log yn cofnodi gwiriadau rheolaidd ac ailosod cyffuriau, chwistrellau a nodwyddau sydd wedi dod i ben.','Emergency drugs and check log.',51),
('health_safety','H9','Drugs and prescription pads are stored securely, and adverse drug reactions are reported (e.g. Yellow Card).','Cedwir cyffuriau a phadiau presgripsiwn yn ddiogel, ac adroddir ar adweithiau niweidiol i gyffuriau (e.e. Cerdyn Melyn).','Staff interview; drug storage.',52),
('health_safety','H10','Domiciliary visits (if any) are supported with the required emergency equipment.','Cefnogir ymweliadau cartref (os oes rhai) gyda''r offer brys gofynnol.','Applicable only if domiciliary visits are made.',53),
('health_safety','H11','There are contracts for clinical waste, amalgam, sharps and non-hazardous waste, and waste is segregated with correct colour-coded containers.','Mae contractau ar gyfer gwastraff clinigol, amalgam, eitemau miniog a gwastraff nad yw''n beryglus, ac mae gwastraff wedi''i wahanu mewn cynwysyddion â''r lliw cywir.','Waste contracts and transfer notes; observation.',54),
('health_safety','H12','Clinical waste awaiting collection is stored securely, extracted teeth are handled correctly, and unused medicines are managed.','Storir gwastraff clinigol sy''n aros i''w gasglu yn ddiogel, trinnir dannedd a dynnwyd yn gywir, a rheolir meddyginiaethau nas defnyddiwyd.','Observation of waste store.',55),
('health_safety','H13','Amalgam separators are installed and mercury spillages are dealt with by a documented procedure.','Mae gwahanyddion amalgam wedi''u gosod a thrinnir colledion mercwri yn ôl gweithdrefn ddogfenedig.','Separator service record; spill kit.',56),
('health_safety','H14','Dangerous materials (gas cylinders, chemicals) are stored appropriately and COSHH assessments are in place.','Storir deunyddiau peryglus (silindrau nwy, cemegau) yn briodol ac mae asesiadau COSHH ar waith.','COSHH file; observation of storage.',57),
('health_safety','H15','Surgeries are in good condition, easily cleansable, clean, with sealed floors and work surfaces.','Mae''r meddygfeydd mewn cyflwr da, yn hawdd eu glanhau, yn lân, gyda lloriau ac arwynebau gwaith wedi''u selio.','Observation of each surgery.',58),
('health_safety','H16','Clinical equipment is in good order and in sufficient number (handpieces, scalers, instruments, curing lights), with PPE and single-use items in stock and eye protection for patients and staff.','Mae offer clinigol mewn cyflwr da ac yn ddigonol (darnau llaw, graffwyr, offerynnau, goleuadau halltu), gydag offer diogelu personol ac eitemau untro mewn stoc a diogelwch llygaid i gleifion a staff.','Observation; stock checks.',59),
('health_safety','H17','The compressor has daily checks, a maintenance scheme and an in-date inspection certificate (maximum interval 26 months).','Mae gan y cywasgydd wiriadau dyddiol, cynllun cynnal a chadw a thystysgrif archwilio o fewn dyddiad (uchafswm 26 mis).','Compressor log and certificate.',60),
('health_safety','H18','Portable appliance (PAT) testing is carried out regularly, and gas appliances have a current safety certificate.','Cynhelir profion offer cludadwy (PAT) yn rheolaidd, ac mae gan offer nwy dystysgrif diogelwch gyfredol.','PAT records; gas safety certificate.',61),
('health_safety','H19','Needle re-sheathing devices and heavy-duty gloves are available, and sharps are handled safely (wall-mounted sharps bins).','Mae dyfeisiau ailwisgo nodwyddau a menig trwm ar gael, a thrinnir eitemau miniog yn ddiogel (biniau eitemau miniog ar y wal).','Observation.',62),
('policies','P1','A Data Protection policy (patients) and Data Security policy (staff) are in place.','Mae polisi Diogelu Data (cleifion) a pholisi Diogelwch Data (staff) ar waith.','Policy documents with review dates.',63),
('policies','P2','A Health and Safety policy is in place covering manual handling, PPE, work equipment and workplace risk assessments (if more than five staff).','Mae polisi Iechyd a Diogelwch ar waith sy''n cwmpasu codi a chario, offer diogelu personol, offer gwaith ac asesiadau risg gweithle (os oes mwy na phump o staff).','Policy and risk assessments.',64),
('policies','P3','A Display Screen Equipment assessment has been completed for staff who use screens.','Mae asesiad Offer Sgrin Arddangos wedi''i gwblhau ar gyfer staff sy''n defnyddio sgriniau.','DSE assessments.',65),
('policies','P4','A patient privacy, dignity and confidentiality policy exists.','Mae polisi preifatrwydd, urddas a chyfrinachedd cleifion yn bodoli.','Policy document.',66),
('policies','P5','An accident book is kept (RIDDOR) with HSE contact details and the reporting protocol.','Cedwir llyfr damweiniau (RIDDOR) gyda manylion cyswllt HSE a''r protocol adrodd.','Accident book.',67),
('policies','P6','A Freedom of Information Act compliance document is available.','Mae dogfen cydymffurfio â Deddf Rhyddid Gwybodaeth ar gael.','Policy document.',68),
('policies','P7','Child protection and adult protection policies are in place and reviewed.','Mae polisïau amddiffyn plant ac amddiffyn oedolion ar waith ac wedi''u hadolygu.','Policies with named safeguarding lead.',69),
('policies','P8','Complaints and whistleblowing policies are in place.','Mae polisïau cwynion a chwythu''r chwiban ar waith.','Policy documents.',70),
('policies','P9','Radiation protection and resuscitation policies are in place.','Mae polisïau diogelu rhag ymbelydredd ac adfywio ar waith.','Policy documents.',71),
('policies','P10','Waste storage and disposal, mercury handling and infection control policies are in place, with an infection control audit.','Mae polisïau storio a gwaredu gwastraff, trin mercwri a rheoli heintiau ar waith, gydag archwiliad rheoli heintiau.','Policy documents; latest audit.',72),
('policies','P11','An equal opportunities policy is in place.','Mae polisi cyfle cyfartal ar waith.','Policy document.',73),
('policies','P12','A fire equipment maintenance contract is in place, and staff training records and certificates are kept (IR(ME)R, CPR).','Mae cytundeb cynnal a chadw offer tân ar waith, a chedwir cofnodion a thystysgrifau hyfforddi staff (IR(ME)R, CPR).','Contract; training file.',74);


insert into public.training_modules (kind, title_en, title_cy, summary_en, summary_cy, points_en, points_cy, duration_mins, sort) values
('induction','Welcome and practice induction','Croeso a sefydlu''r practis',
 'Introduces new starters to the practice, its policies and who to go to for what.',
 'Yn cyflwyno staff newydd i''r practis, ei bolisïau a phwy i''w holi am beth.',
 array['Practice layout, emergency procedures and fire evacuation','Who''s who and reporting lines','Where to find policies and how to confirm you have read them','Confidentiality and patient information'],
 array['Cynllun y practis, gweithdrefnau brys a gwacáu tân','Pwy yw pwy a llinellau adrodd','Ble i ddod o hyd i bolisïau a sut i gadarnhau eich bod wedi''u darllen','Cyfrinachedd a gwybodaeth cleifion'],
 30,1),
('induction','Pre-employment checks checklist','Rhestr wirio gwiriadau cyn-cyflogaeth',
 'Confirms every pre-employment requirement has been met before a new starter works unsupervised.',
 'Yn cadarnhau bod pob gofyniad cyn-cyflogaeth wedi''i fodloni cyn i ddechreuwr newydd weithio heb oruchwyliaeth.',
 array['Two satisfactory references and a full employment history','Enhanced DBS check recorded','Right to work and professional registration (GDC) verified','Indemnity and immunisation status recorded'],
 array['Dau eirda boddhaol a hanes cyflogaeth llawn','Gwiriad DBS uwch wedi''i gofnodi','Hawl i weithio a chofrestru proffesiynol (GDC) wedi''u gwirio','Statws indemniad ac imiwneiddio wedi''i gofnodi'],
 20,2),
('induction','Infection prevention and decontamination basics (WHTM 01-05)','Hanfodion atal heintiau a diheintio (WHTM 01-05)',
 'Core infection control and decontamination awareness for every team member.',
 'Ymwybyddiaeth graidd o reoli heintiau a diheintio ar gyfer pob aelod o''r tîm.',
 array['Hand hygiene and PPE','Instrument journey: clean, inspect, sterilise, store','Daily and weekly equipment test records','Sharps and waste handling'],
 array['Hylendid dwylo a PPE','Taith offerynnau: glanhau, archwilio, sterileiddio, storio','Cofnodion profion offer dyddiol ac wythnosol','Trin sharps a gwastraff'],
 45,3),
('induction','Radiation protection awareness (IR(ME)R)','Ymwybyddiaeth o ddiogelu rhag ymbelydredd (IR(ME)R)',
 'Awareness training for everyone working near dental X-ray equipment.',
 'Hyfforddiant ymwybyddiaeth i bawb sy''n gweithio ger offer pelydr-X deintyddol.',
 array['Local rules and controlled areas','Justification and optimisation of exposures','Roles of the RPA and supervisor','Quality assurance and record keeping'],
 array['Rheolau lleol ac ardaloedd rheoledig','Cyfiawnhau a gwneud y gorau o amlygiadau','Rolau''r RPA a''r goruchwyliwr','Sicrhau ansawdd a chadw cofnodion'],
 30,4),
('induction','Safeguarding adults and children','Diogelu oedolion a phlant',
 'Recognising and reporting safeguarding concerns in a dental setting.',
 'Adnabod ac adrodd pryderon diogelu mewn lleoliad deintyddol.',
 array['Types and signs of abuse and neglect','The Wales Safeguarding Procedures','How to raise and record a concern','Practice safeguarding lead and contacts'],
 array['Mathau ac arwyddion cam-drin ac esgeulustod','Gweithdrefnau Diogelu Cymru','Sut i godi a chofnodi pryder','Arweinydd diogelu''r practis a chysylltiadau'],
 40,5),

('refresher','Infection control — annual refresher','Rheoli heintiau — adnewyddiad blynyddol',
 'Annual CPD-aligned refresher on infection prevention and control.',
 'Adnewyddiad blynyddol wedi''i alinio â DPP ar atal a rheoli heintiau.',
 array['What changed in guidance this year','Audit findings and lessons learned','Spot-checks: PPE, hand hygiene, environmental cleaning'],
 array['Beth sydd wedi newid mewn canllawiau eleni','Canfyddiadau archwilio a gwersi a ddysgwyd','Gwiriadau pwynt: PPE, hylendid dwylo, glanhau amgylcheddol'],
 30,10),
